# Density Compare
# Meitnerium (Mt) — real density 37.4 g/cm³. equal masses: Meitnerium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Meitnerium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 6.0mm color: #d040ff at (-20mm, 3.0mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 298.3 g — the water cube is the reference
